{"id":"d9d13f2ac55f5a6d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-propositional-proof-system.md","title":"Propositional Proof System","display":"df-propositional-proof-system — Propositional Proof System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-propositional-proof-system","aliases":["72-df-propositional-proof-system"],"display":"df-propositional-proof-system — Propositional Proof System","depends_on":["[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","[[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]]"],"source_location":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 2.1; printed pp. 549-550; PDF pp. 561-562","source_statement_status":"source-statement-compared","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-propositional-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-propositional-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-propositional-proof-system — Propositional Proof System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"75e696732042abd2\" href=\"?note=75e696732042abd2\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy\">72-df-polynomial-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Pudlak, Chapter VIII, section 2.1; printed pp. 549-550; PDF pp. 561-562"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-statement-compared"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\mathrm{TAUT}\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是命题重言式的固定二进制编码集合（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>）。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FP}\">\\(\\mathrm{FP}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PTIME}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PTIME}_2\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"75e696732042abd2\" href=\"?note=75e696732042abd2\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy\">72-df-polynomial-hierarchy</a> 的显式机器模型，按下式转为串函数和二元串关系。多项式具有非负整数系数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{num}\">\\(\\operatorname{num}\\)</span> 为该依赖的二进制数值函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(P:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq(\\Sigma^*)^2\">\\(V\\subseteq(\\Sigma^*)^2\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PTIME}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{PTIME}_2\\)</span> 由下式定义；其输入是两串而非证明树对象。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}: (\\Sigma^*)^2\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}: (\\Sigma^*)^2\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 是固定单射、可多项式时间编码和解析的配对函数，编码长度至多为输入总长的固定多项式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{decPair}:\\Sigma^*\\to(\\Sigma^*)^2\\cup\\{\\dagger\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{decPair}:\\Sigma^*\\to(\\Sigma^*)^2\\cup\\{\\dagger\\}\\)</span> 在合法编码上为逆，在非法编码上为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dagger\\notin(\\Sigma^*)^2\">\\(\\dagger\\notin(\\Sigma^*)^2\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_0=\\operatorname{enc}(\\top)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\">\\(\\tau_0=\\operatorname{enc}(\\top)\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda\">\\(\\Lambda\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f9452e4a7788a117\" href=\"?note=f9452e4a7788a117\" title=\"72-df-sequent-calculus\">72-df-sequent-calculus</a> 的一阶签名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Lambda)\">\\(\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Lambda)\\)</span> 为其序列语境的判断集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ax},\\mathsf{cut},\\mathsf{\\omega R}\">\\(\\mathsf{ax},\\mathsf{cut},\\mathsf{\\omega R}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" href=\"?note=d940a4cbbc0bf9c9\" title=\"72-df-sequent-rule\">72-df-sequent-rule</a> 的互异固定标签；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是待检验的集合编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal C,\\Lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal C,\\Lambda)\\)</span> 在 Assertion 构造带标签判断演算的结构谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\)</span> 是另一个关于串函数的谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_P\">\\(R_P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_V\">\\(P_V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropVerifier}(V)\">\\(\\operatorname{PropVerifier}(V)\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,\\tau,\\rho\">\\(w,\\tau,\\rho\\)</span> 取二进制串。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>最后一式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\operatorname{wn}(u),\\operatorname{wn}(v)\\rangle\\in Q\">\\(\\langle\\operatorname{wn}(u),\\operatorname{wn}(v)\\rangle\\in Q\\)</span> 的内层自然数对为二项函数序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in V\">\\(\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in V\\)</span> 为有序对。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wn}\">\\(\\operatorname{wn}\\)</span> 的逆存在唯一，长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 的串对应自然数区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[2^j-1,2^{j+1}-2]\">\\([2^j-1,2^{j+1}-2]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\n\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nP\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\n\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\nP\\in\\mathrm{FP}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal C,\\Lambda)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R,\\mathsf{Tag},W\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Lambda)\\land\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\mathsf{ax},\\mathsf{cut},\\mathsf{\\omega R}\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tag}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\bigcup_{I\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\}}(\\mathsf{Tag}\\times W\\times Q^I\\times Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t,w,p,q\\;(\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\to t\\ne\\mathsf{ax})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal C,\\Lambda)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R,\\mathsf{Tag},W\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathcal C=\\langle Q,\\mathsf{Ax},\\mathsf R\\rangle\\land Q\\subseteq\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Lambda)\\land\\mathsf{Ax}\\subseteq Q\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\{\\mathsf{ax},\\mathsf{cut},\\mathsf{\\omega R}\\}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Tag}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf R\\subseteq\\bigcup_{I\\in\\omega\\cup\\{\\omega\\}}(\\mathsf{Tag}\\times W\\times Q^I\\times Q)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t,w,p,q\\;(\\langle t,w,p,q\\rangle\\in\\mathsf R\\to t\\ne\\mathsf{ax})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropVerifier}(V)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nV\\in\\mathrm{PTIME}_2\\land\\forall\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(\\tau,\\rho)\\in V\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PropVerifier}(V)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nV\\in\\mathrm{PTIME}_2\\land\\forall\\tau\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\n\\bigl(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(\\tau,\\rho)\\in V\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_P:=\\{(\\tau,\\rho)\\in(\\Sigma^*)^2:P(\\rho)=\\tau\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_P:=\\{(\\tau,\\rho)\\in(\\Sigma^*)^2:P(\\rho)=\\tau\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP_V:={}&amp;\\{\\langle w,\\tau\\rangle\\in(\\Sigma^*)^2:\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(\\operatorname{decPair}(w)=\\langle\\tau,\\rho\\rangle\\land(\\tau,\\rho)\\in V)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle w,\\tau_0\\rangle:w\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\tau,\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(\\operatorname{decPair}(w)=\\langle\\tau,\\rho\\rangle\\land(\\tau,\\rho)\\in V)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP_V:={}&amp;\\{\\langle w,\\tau\\rangle\\in(\\Sigma^*)^2:\n\\exists\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(\\operatorname{decPair}(w)=\\langle\\tau,\\rho\\rangle\\land(\\tau,\\rho)\\in V)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\langle w,\\tau_0\\rangle:w\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\n\\neg\\exists\\tau,\\rho\\in\\Sigma^*\\;(\\operatorname{decPair}(w)=\\langle\\tau,\\rho\\rangle\\land(\\tau,\\rho)\\in V)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\to\\operatorname{PropVerifier}(R_P),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PropVerifier}(V)\\to\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P_V).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P)\\to\\operatorname{PropVerifier}(R_P),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{PropVerifier}(V)\\to\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P_V).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{wn}(w)&amp;:=2^{|w|}-1+\\operatorname{num}(w),\\qquad\\operatorname{nw}(n):=\\iota w\\in\\Sigma^*\\ (\\operatorname{wn}(w)=n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FP}&amp;:=\\{P\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{\\Sigma^*}:\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}_1(\\varnothing)\\ \\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\ P(w)=\\operatorname{nw}(f(\\langle\\operatorname{wn}(w)\\rangle))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PTIME}_2&amp;:=\\{V\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*: \\exists Q\\in\\mathbf P_2(\\varnothing)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\Sigma^*\\ (\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in V\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\operatorname{wn}(u),\\operatorname{wn}(v)\\rangle\\in Q)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{wn}(w)&amp;:=2^{|w|}-1+\\operatorname{num}(w),\\qquad\\operatorname{nw}(n):=\\iota w\\in\\Sigma^*\\ (\\operatorname{wn}(w)=n),\\\\\n\\mathrm{FP}&amp;:=\\{P\\in(\\Sigma^*)^{\\Sigma^*}:\\exists f\\in\\mathbf{FP}_1(\\varnothing)\\ \\forall w\\in\\Sigma^*\\ P(w)=\\operatorname{nw}(f(\\langle\\operatorname{wn}(w)\\rangle))\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{PTIME}_2&amp;:=\\{V\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*: \\exists Q\\in\\mathbf P_2(\\varnothing)\\ \\forall u,v\\in\\Sigma^*\\ (\\langle u,v\\rangle\\in V\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\operatorname{wn}(u),\\operatorname{wn}(v)\\rangle\\in Q)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Pudlák，Chapter VIII，§2.1，印刷页 549–550，PDF 页 561–562。原书采用多项式时间二元验证关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\tau,\\pi)\">\\(R(\\tau,\\pi)\\)</span>，并要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\,R(\\tau,\\pi)\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\,R(\\tau,\\pi)\\)</span>；此处保留已有 Cook–Reckhow 总函数版本。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>两种表示等价：由总函数取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(\\tau,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow P(\\pi)=\\tau\">\\(R(\\tau,\\pi)\\leftrightarrow P(\\pi)=\\tau\\)</span>；反向将候选公式及证书编码在输入中，通过验证时输出公式，未通过时输出固定重言式。后一转换的输入长度包括公式编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本次核对了原书关系定义及上述表示转换；没有从定义推断所有重言式都具有多项式长证明。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>结构接口与 Cook–Reckhow 接口分别构造：前者保存判断载集、初始判断与四元带标签规则实例，可含可数前提，且不预设有效性；后者必须是总多项式时间串函数，值域恰为重言式编码。它们不是同一对象类型，结构合法性不推出 Cook–Reckhow 性质。把具体演算转成后者，还需另外给出有限证明编码、可多项式验证的证书，以及对重言式的可靠性和完备性。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>最后两式给出原书二元验证关系与总函数定义的实际转换。解析成功且验证通过时输出其公式，否则输出固定重言式；两分支互斥且覆盖，合法配对的唯一性保证函数单值。总运行时间多项式；验证关系的完备性保证每个重言式有原像。此转换不为结构演算补造未给定的证明检验算法。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-rule","status":"resolved","id":"d940a4cbbc0bf9c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-sequent-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"75e696732042abd2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathrm{TAUT}\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$ 是命题重言式的固定二进制编码集合（见 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"75e696732042abd2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FP}$ 与 $\\mathrm{PTIME}_2$ 使用 [[72-df-polynomial-hierarchy]] 的显式机器模型，按下式转为串函数和二元串关系。多项式具有非负整数系数。$\\operatorname{num}$ 为该依赖的二进制数值函数。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-sequent-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"f9452e4a7788a117","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Lambda$ 为 [[72-df-sequent-calculus]] 的一阶签名，$\\mathrm{Seq}(\\Lambda)$ 为其序列语境的判断集合。$\\mathsf{ax},\\mathsf{cut},\\mathsf{\\omega R}$ 取 [[72-df-sequent-rule]] 的互异固定标签；$\\mathcal C$ 是待检验的集合编码。$\\operatorname{ProofSystem}(\\mathcal C,\\Lambda)$ 在 Assertion 构造带标签判断演算的结构谓词；$\\operatorname{